<title>USA: Gentner CFO steps down.</title>
<headline>Gentner CFO steps down.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gentner Communications Corp said Tuesday its Chief Financial Officer David Harmon has chosen to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>The company said Susie Strohm, who has functioned as Gentner's controller for one year, has been named assistant vice president of Finance and will assume the responsibilities of the Chief Financial Officer position.</p>
<p>The company said that, as planned, it will show a loss for this quarter, though the period will show &quot;substantial revenue growth over the same quarter last year.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said it is undergoing restructuring.</p>
</text>
